<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="de">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <title>Dein Profil – PawMatch</title>

  <style>
    :root {
      --background: #faf7f3;
      --surface: #fffdfa;
      --text: #322f2b;
      --muted: #70695f;
      --border: #e9e1d8;
      --green: #285b43;
      --green-light: #e1f0e5;
      --green-soft: #f0f6f1;
    }

    * {
      box-sizing: border-box;
    }

    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: var(--background);
      color: var(--text);
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 15px;
      line-height: 1.6;
    }

    a {
      color: inherit;
      text-decoration: none;
    }

    button,
    input {
      font: inherit;
    }

    button,
    .button {
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    a:focus-visible,
    button:focus-visible,
    input:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid var(--green);
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    .site-header {
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    }

    .navigation {
      max-width: 1140px;
      min-height: 72px;
      margin: auto;
      padding: 14px 24px;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 28px;
    }

    .brand {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 10px;
      font: bold 23px Georgia, serif;
    }

    .brand-icon {
      width: 34px;
      height: 34px;
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--green);
      color: white;
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    .nav-links,
    .account {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 26px;
    }

    .nav-links {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .badge {
      padding: 1px 5px;
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--green);
      color: white;
      font-size: 10px;
      vertical-align: top;
    }

    .button {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 8px;
      padding: 7px 17px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--surface);
      color: var(--text);
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .icon-button {
      padding: 4px;
      border: 0;
      background: transparent;
      color: var(--text);
      font-size: 20px;
    }

    main {
      max-width: 1040px;
      margin: 42px auto;
      padding: 0 24px;
    }

    .intro {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-end;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 24px;
      margin-bottom: 28px;
    }

    .eyebrow {
      margin: 0 0 9px;
      color: #3d7956;
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 700;
      letter-spacing: 2px;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    h1,
    h2 {
      font-family: Georgia, serif;
      line-height: 1.2;
      letter-spacing: -1px;
    }

    h1 {
      margin: 0 0 12px;
      font-size: 48px;
    }

    h2 {
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      font-size: 25px;
    }

    p {
      margin: 0;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .intro p:last-child {
      max-width: 510px;
    }

    .intro .button {
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }

    .profile-layout {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 248px minmax(0, 1fr);
      gap: 20px;
      align-items: start;
    }

    .card {
      padding: 22px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 17px;
      background: var(--surface);
    }

    .profile-card {
      text-align: center;
    }

    .avatar {
      display: grid;
      place-items: center;
      width: 76px;
      height: 76px;
      margin: 0 auto 12px;
      border: 5px solid var(--green-soft);
      border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--green-light);
      color: var(--green);
      font: bold 25px Georgia, serif;
    }

    .profile-card h2 {
      margin-bottom: 2px;
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .progress {
      width: 100%;
      height: 5px;
      margin: 20px 0 6px;
      overflow: hidden;
      border-radius: 5px;
      background: var(--green-light);
    }

    .progress-fill {
      width: 85%;
      height: 100%;
      background: #3d7956;
    }

    .completion {
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .status-list {
      display: grid;
      gap: 9px;
      margin: 20px 0 0;
      padding: 16px 0 0;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
      list-style: none;
      text-align: left;
      color: var(--muted);
    }

    .status-list li {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 8px;
    }

    .status-icon {
      color: #4a8a64;
    }

    .details {
      display: grid;
      gap: 14px;
    }

    .card-heading {
      display: flex;
      justify-content: space-between;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 16px;
    }

    .section-icon {
      color: #3d7956;
      font-size: 24px;
    }

    .fields {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
      gap: 12px;
      margin: 0;
    }

    .fields dt {
      margin-bottom: 5px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .fields dd {
      margin: 0;
      padding: 6px 12px;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--background);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .tags {
      display: flex;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 6px;
      margin: 0 0 16px;
      padding: 0;
      list-style: none;
    }

    .tags li {
      padding: 4px 9px;
      border-radius: 999px;
      background: var(--green-light);
      color: var(--green);
      font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 600;
    }

    .search-button {
      border-color: transparent;
      background: var(--green-soft);
      color: var(--green);
    }

    .verification-status {
      margin-bottom: 14px;
      padding: 10px 24px;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--background);
    }

    .verification-status strong {
      display: block;
    }

    .upload {
      position: relative;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 12px;
      margin-top: 16px;
      padding: 14px 16px;
      border: 1px dashed #a8cfb5;
      border-radius: 10px;
      background: var(--green-soft);
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .upload input {
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      width: 100%;
      height: 100%;
      opacity: 0;
      cursor: pointer;
    }

    .upload:focus-within {
      outline: 3px solid var(--green);
      outline-offset: 3px;
    }

    .upload strong,
    .upload small {
      display: block;
    }

    .upload small {
      color: var(--muted);
      font-size: 14px;
    }

    @media (max-width: 1000px) {
      .navigation {
        flex-wrap: wrap;
      }

      .nav-links {
        order: 3;
        width: 100%;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 12px 22px;
      }
    }

    @media (max-width: 700px) {
      main {
        margin-top: 28px;
        padding: 0 16px;
      }

      .intro {
        align-items: flex-start;
        flex-direction: column;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 40px;
      }

      .profile-layout,
      .fields {
        grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      }

      .navigation {
        padding-inline: 16px;
        gap: 16px;
      }

      .account {
        gap: 10px;
      }

      .card {
        padding: 20px;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>

<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <nav class="navigation" aria-label="Hauptnavigation">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <span class="brand-icon" aria-hidden="true">♧</span>
        PawMatch
      </a>

      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/entdecken">Entdecken</a>
        <a href="/favoriten">
          Favoriten <span class="badge">1</span>
        </a>
        <a href="/erfahrungen">Erfahrungen</a>
        <a href="/anfragen">Anfragen &amp; Matches</a>
        <a href="/nachrichten">Nachrichten</a>
      </div>

      <div class="account">
        <button class="icon-button" type="button"
                aria-label="Benachrichtigungen">
          ♧
        </button>
        <a class="button" href="/profil" aria-current="page">
          <span aria-hidden="true">◎</span>
          Lena Hoffmann
        </a>
      </div>
    </nav>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="intro" aria-labelledby="page-title">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Dein PawMatch Profil</p>
        <h1 id="page-title">Hallo, Lena.</h1>
        <p>
          Je vollständiger dein Profil, desto besser können Tierheime
          deine Anfrage einschätzen.
        </p>
      </div>

      <a class="button" href="/profil/bearbeiten">
        <span aria-hidden="true">✎</span>
        Profil bearbeiten
      </a>
    </section>

    <div class="profile-layout">
      <aside class="card profile-card" aria-label="Profilübersicht">
        <div class="avatar" aria-hidden="true">LH</div>
        <h2>Lena Hoffmann</h2>
        <p>Hamburg · seit Februar 2026</p>

        <div class="progress" role="progressbar"
             aria-label="Profilvollständigkeit"
             aria-valuenow="85" aria-valuemin="0" aria-valuemax="100">
          <div class="progress-fill"></div>
        </div>
        <p class="completion">Profil zu 85 % vollständig</p>

        <ul class="status-list">
          <li>
            <span class="status-icon" aria-hidden="true">◷</span>
            Identitätsprüfung ausstehend
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="status-icon" aria-hidden="true">✓</span>
            E-Mail verifiziert
          </li>
          <li>
            <span class="status-icon" aria-hidden="true">◷</span>
            Antwortet meist am selben Tag
          </li>
        </ul>
      </aside>

      <div class="details">
        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="housing-title">
          <div class="card-heading">
            <div>
              <p class="eyebrow">Über dich</p>
              <h2 id="housing-title">Wohnsituation</h2>
            </div>
            <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">⌂</span>
          </div>

          <dl class="fields">
            <div>
              <dt>Wohnform</dt>
              <dd>Wohnung mit Balkon</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Haushalt</dt>
              <dd>2 Erwachsene</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Umgebung</dt>
              <dd>Stadtnah, Park in 5 Minuten</dd>
            </div>
            <div>
              <dt>Vermieterzustimmung</dt>
              <dd>Liegt vor</dd>
            </div>
          </dl>
        </section>

        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="experience-title">
          <p class="eyebrow">Erfahrung</p>
          <h2 id="experience-title">Leben mit Tieren</h2>
          <p>
            Ich bin mit Hunden aufgewachsen und habe in den letzten
            zwei Jahren regelmäßig einen Tierschutzhund betreut.
            Wir suchen einen aktiven, menschenbezogenen Begleiter.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="preferences-title">
          <p class="eyebrow">Wünsche</p>
          <h2 id="preferences-title">Präferenzen</h2>

          <ul class="tags" aria-label="Bevorzugte Eigenschaften">
            <li>Hund</li>
            <li>2–6 Jahre</li>
            <li>Bis 50 km</li>
            <li>Kinderfreundlich</li>
            <li>Aktiv</li>
          </ul>

          <a class="button search-button"
             href="/entdecken?tierart=hund&amp;alterMin=2&amp;alterMax=6&amp;radius=50&amp;kinderfreundlich=1&amp;aktiv=1">
            <span aria-hidden="true">☷</span>
            Suche mit diesen Filtern starten
          </a>
        </section>

        <section class="card" aria-labelledby="verification-title">
          <p class="eyebrow">Separater Sicherheitsschritt</p>
          <h2 id="verification-title">Verifizierung</h2>

          <div class="verification-status">
            <p>Aktueller Status</p>
            <strong>Noch nicht eingereicht</strong>
          </div>

          <p>
            Lade einen gültigen Ausweis hoch. Deine Identität wird
            ausschließlich zur Sicherheit der Vermittlung geprüft.
          </p>

          <label class="upload">
            <span class="section-icon" aria-hidden="true">↥</span>
            <span>
              <strong>Ausweis auswählen</strong>
              <small id="upload-hint">
                PDF, JPG oder PNG · maximal 10 MB
              </small>
            </span>
            <input type="file" name="ausweis"
                   accept=".pdf,.jpg,.jpeg,.png"
                   aria-label="Ausweis auswählen"
                   aria-describedby="upload-hint">
          </label>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>